# TryHackMe — Cyber Security 101: Hands-On Portfolio

**Status:** 🔵 In Progress

The Cyber Security 101 path builds on the technical foundations established during Pre Security and introduces more dedicated cybersecurity concepts, tools and practical environments.

The path develops knowledge across areas including Linux and Windows security, networking, Active Directory, offensive security, exploitation, web application security, defensive security, digital forensics and security careers.

This section of my portfolio focuses particularly on the **practical and hands-on elements** of the path.

---

