## Learning Alongside TryHackMe

This practical training is being undertaken alongside:

* **NCFE Level 3 Cyber Security Practices** — In Progress
* **CompTIA Security+** — Currently Studying

The combination of formal study and practical lab work is intended to develop both theoretical understanding and practical capability.

